><div class="framer-1y84bpm" data-framer-name="Top Content"><div class="framer-yar6ti" data-framer-name="Heading" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-paragraph-spacing:0px;transform:none"><h5 class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-a75zjm" data-styles-preset="s9hTDsea6" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">"Simply Superior"</h5></div><div class="framer-1iqbafv" data-framer-name="Text" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-b747b483-3b52-4e86-96f4-3e72ab028788, rgb(46, 18, 94));--framer-paragraph-spacing:0px;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1j8am70" data-styles-preset="C28EYli78" style="--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-b747b483-3b52-4e86-96f4-3e72ab028788, rgb(46, 18, 94)))">"For the past 6 years, Sellout has and continues to be a critical contributor to the success of Live From The Divide. Its unique ability to address both patrons' and event producers' needs with real-time digital solutions sets it apart. After trying larger, well-known competitors, I can confidently say that Sellout is simply a superior product."</p></div></div><div class="framer-19ahgx4" data-framer-name="Divider" style="background-color:var(--token-263a7f64-5dbd-42c8-80ee-6e4b6c30e99b, rgb(236, 233, 254));border-bottom-left-radius:124px;border-bottom-right-radius:124px;border-top-left-radius:124px;border-top-right-radius:124px"></div><div class="framer-1aouj90" data-framer-name="Avatar Content"><div class="framer-1b8a6ze" data-framer-name="Name" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-b747b483-3b52-4e86-96f4-3e72ab028788, rgb(46, 18, 94));--framer-paragraph-spacing:0px;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-379fyl" data-styles-preset="sZJOcJc3C" style="--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-b747b483-3b52-4e86-96f4-3e72ab028788, rgb(46, 18, 94)))">Jason Wickens</p></div><div class="framer-1qp3efq" data-framer-name="Title" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-dc8aca8a-ac09-4e10-ab2f-f2231c534f86, rgb(255, 68, 5));--framer-paragraph-spacing:0px;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1lg0dbl" data-styles-preset="OyLfwjIhE" style="--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-dc8aca8a-ac09-4e10-ab2f-f2231c534f86, rgb(255, 68, 5)))">CEO, Live from the Divide</p></div></div></div></div></div></li><li style="display:contents" aria-hidden="true"><div class="framer-186mpl9-container" style="flex-shrink:0;user-select:none;width:100%;height:100%;opacity:1;transform:none;transform-origin:100% 50% 0"><div class="framer-F4phz framer-m9hhG framer-jH7XP framer-rHuBk framer-b6aEN framer-1p92qy1 framer-v-1p92qy1" data-framer-name="Default" style="background-color:var(--token-f56fa820-1572-4c50-a85d-c5aa6415847a, rgb(252, 252, 253));height:100%;width:100%;border-bottom-left-radius:32px;border-bottom-right-radius:32px;border-top-left-radius:32px;border-top-right-radius:32px"><div class="framer-e7ddq6" data-framer-name="Headshot" style="border-bottom-left-radius:100%;border-bottom-right-radius:100%;border-top-left-radius:100%;border-top-right-radius:100%"><div style="position:absolute;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;top:0;right:0;bottom:0;left:0" data-framer-background-image-wrapper="true"><img decoding="async" src="https://framerusercontent.com/images/StL23gVBd6ypWfnY0of7JTACOs.jpeg" alt style="display:block;width:100%;height:100%;border-radius:inherit;corner-shape:inherit;object-position:center;object-fit:cover"></div></div><div class="framer-5x7v9w" data-framer-name="Content"><div class="framer-1y84bpm" data-framer-name="Top Content"><div class="framer-yar6ti" data-framer-name="Heading" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--framer-paragraph-spacing:0px;transform:none"><h5 class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-a75zjm" data-styles-preset="s9hTDsea6" dir="auto" style="--framer-text-alignment:center">"Transformative"</h5></div><div class="framer-1iqbafv" data-framer-name="Text" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-b747b483-3b52-4e86-96f4-3e72ab028788, rgb(46, 18, 94));--framer-paragraph-spacing:0px;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-1j8am70" data-styles-preset="C28EYli78" style="--framer-text-alignment:center;--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-b747b483-3b52-4e86-96f4-3e72ab028788, rgb(46, 18, 94)))">If I had to choose one word to describe our experience with Sellout, it would be "Transformative." The positive impact of using Sellout has transformed the way we approach event management. From simplifying ticket sales to enhancing the overall attendee experience, it has been instrumental in elevating our summer concert series to new heights."</p></div></div><div class="framer-19ahgx4" data-framer-name="Divider" style="background-color:var(--token-263a7f64-5dbd-42c8-80ee-6e4b6c30e99b, rgb(236, 233, 254));border-bottom-left-radius:124px;border-bottom-right-radius:124px;border-top-left-radius:124px;border-top-right-radius:124px"></div><div class="framer-1aouj90" data-framer-name="Avatar Content"><div class="framer-1b8a6ze" data-framer-name="Name" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-b747b483-3b52-4e86-96f4-3e72ab028788, rgb(46, 18, 94));--framer-paragraph-spacing:0px;transform:none"><p class="framer-text framer-styles-preset-379fyl" data-styles-preset="sZJOcJc3C" style="--framer-text-color:var(--extracted-r6o4lv, var(--token-b747b483-3b52-4e86-96f4-3e72ab028788, rgb(46, 18, 94)))">Hayden Wilson</p></div><div class="framer-1qp3efq" data-framer-name="Title" data-framer-component-type="RichTextContainer" style="--extracted-r6o4lv:var(--token-dc8aca8a-ac09-4e10-ab2f-f2231c534f86, rgb(255, 68, 5));--framer-paragraph-spacing:0px;tra